Most patches don't look to config.h to be active.  Generally, if
config.h (in the source tree) must be changed, the patch author will
have made some effort to tell you.  defaults.nh (in the binary
directory after a successful compile) is a run-time configuration file
only; it can be changed whenever, but few patches ask that it be.

